	(descr "Skyworks SE5004L 5 GHz PA, QFN-20 4x4 mm P0.5. Land per SE5004L DS 202393B Fig. 5 (p7): pins 0.25 x 0.70, ground metal = pad 21 (centre 2.60 + frame over GND pins 2, 4, 11, 12, 14-17 and NU pin 1, corner blocks, 0.10 neck), F.Cu only, centre mask opening 2.40 (mask defined), paste 2x2 x 0.95. Pin 1 (NU) lies in the ground metal: tie it to GND. DS via pattern 25 x 0.25 on 0.5 pitch: EP vias placed on the board (P5). | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: pin toe and ground metal clipped at 2.06 (4.000+-0.050 -> 2.025 max + 0.035), heel 1.50 and width 0.25 kept, centre metal/mask/paste unchanged")
